  CHECKER_DECL
    LINE_COMMENT "// A checker's formals may be untyped, a sequence or a property, and default"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// to a sequence; its body holds what a module may, and checks with it. An"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// event may be passed to one, and it may be instantiated in a procedure or"
    WHITESPACE "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT "// from a package."
